=== GALACTIC PILOT GUIDE: COMMODITIES & STARPORTS ===

Commodities: Fuel Ore (15 cr), Organics (35 cr), Equipment (80 cr)
4-Letter Port Codes: [Ore, Organics, Equipment, Services]
  Commodity Codes: 'B' = Port Buys, 'S' = Port Sells
  Service Tier (4th Code):
    '-' = Standard (Commerce & Fuel Refinery only)
    'B' = Branch Outpost (Outfitter + Bank Vault) [10% chance]
    'H' = Sector Mega-Hub (Outfitter + Bank + Shipyard) [5% chance]

* Class 1 [BSS-]: Buys Ore        | Sells Organics & Equipment
* Class 2 [SBS-]: Buys Organics   | Sells Ore & Equipment
* Class 3 [SSB-]: Buys Equipment  | Sells Ore & Organics
* Class 4 [SBB-]: Buys Org & Eqp  | Sells Fuel Ore
* Class 5 [BSB-]: Buys Ore & Eqp  | Sells Organics
* Class 6 [BBS-]: Buys Ore & Org  | Sells Equipment
* Class 7 [BBB-]: Import Station  | Buys All 3 Commodities
* Class 8 [SSS-]: Industrial Hub  | Sells All 3 Commodities
